	<annotations>
		<text font-family="Helvetica" font-size="16" id="0" rect="(50.0, 30.0, 900.0, 70.0)">WP1 monoenergetic baseline: 25.52 keV, Ge(880), symmetric Von Hamos, sagittal cylindrical radius 0.25 m.</text>
		<text font-family="Helvetica" font-size="14" id="1" rect="(50.0, 500.0, 900.0, 100.0)">The Sample profile is evaluated q = 0.5146234948 m after the crystal. Plot XY Footprint uses local crystal X (sagittal) and Y (tangential) coordinates. Intensities are SHADOW4 ray weights, not absolute tube flux.</text>
	</annotations>
